  "note": "Lunenburg Primary School roster (Pre-School through grade 3; Nadine Lorenzen is named Primary School cafe manager on page 31). The page names no school in its own text -- identified from its grades and staff. Two columns; the numbers in the left margin of each column are telephone extensions, not roles, and are not recorded. The right-column heading on line 1 is OCR-mangled and is kept verbatim as 'secona Grade' (Second Grade). Lines 18, 19, 21, 25, 28, 34, 42 and 44 carry a heading in one column and a person in the other and are recorded as entries. Julie Drake and Laurie Xarras each appear twice in the source, once under Achieve and once under Tutors. Lines 2-7 have no column heading above them in their own column."
